1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,870
(Penny:)Oh, I think I see our next stop.

2
00:00:04,297 --> 00:00:06,037
(Sheldon:)You can't be serious.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,810
It I wanted to waste my time
on nonsense,

4
00:00:08,969 --> 00:00:10,969
(Sheldon:)I'd follow Leonard on Instagram.

5
00:00:12,305 --> 00:00:16,115
(Penny:)No, come on.
Tonight, we are trying new things.

6
00:00:16,977 --> 00:00:19,817
Oh! That's a lot of incense.

7
00:00:20,413 --> 00:00:22,913
(Sheldon:)Or someone set a hippie on fire.

8
00:00:26,086 --> 00:00:29,126
(Bernadette(on phone):)Yeah, honey,
I'm still stuck at work.

9
00:00:29,289 --> 00:00:32,569
(Howard:)Really?
Penny said that?

10
00:00:34,327 --> 00:00:36,997
(Bernadette(on phone):)Okay, it's true.
I'm sorry.

11
00:00:37,163 --> 00:00:38,973
(Bernadette(on phone):)I'll see you at home.

12
00:00:39,132 --> 00:00:42,012
(Bernadette(on phone):)Yeah, yeah, I'll put it on.

13
00:00:43,169 --> 00:00:46,519
(Leonard:)You and I never just
hang out like this. Why is that?

14
00:00:46,673 --> 00:00:49,513
(Amy:)-I know. it's weird, right?
-Yeah. We should do it more often.

15
00:00:49,676 --> 00:00:52,176
(Amy:)Oh, no. I mean,
this is weird right now.

16
00:00:55,949 --> 00:00:57,789
(Leonard:)-It's Penny.
-ls she still mad?

